This is way too far.

20
00:00:38,039 --> 00:00:38,520
Turn it off!

21
00:00:38,759 --> 00:00:39,240
Someone!

22
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:40,079
Turn it off!

23
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:41,280
Someone!

24
00:00:42,359 --> 00:00:42,880
Stop filming!

25
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:44,520
I said stop filming!

26
00:00:44,520 --> 00:00:45,039
Can't you hear me?

27
00:01:32,959 --> 00:01:33,640
(Don't be afraid.)

28
