Oh my God.

29
00:01:52,959 --> 00:01:53,920
(Don't be afraid.)

30
00:01:54,519 --> 00:01:55,760
(Since you can't avoid it,)

31
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:58,239
(just walk straight into the storm.)

32
00:01:58,719 --> 00:02:00,079
(No one can destroy you.)

33
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:07,040
Yes, that's her!

34
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:07,840
That's her!

35
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:08,880
It's exactly her!

36
00:02:10,520 --> 00:02:11,960
It is her!

37
00:02:13,320 --> 00:02:14,760
What's she trying to do?

38
00:02:16,640 --> 00:02:17,560
She actually came to the gala?

39
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:18,480
She must be desperate.

40
00:02:18,480 --> 00:02:19,760
Doesn't she have any shame?

41
00:02:21,719 --> 00:02:22,360
Mr. Ji.

42
00:02:23,039 --> 00:02:24,400
May I say a few words?

43
00:02:24,599 --> 00:02:25,280
Just five minutes.

44
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:26,439
Sure.

45
00:02:29,760 --> 00:02:31,232
(Ji Group Charity Gala)

46
00:02:31,233 --> 00:02:33,440
(Top lawyer seduces prof to get ahead)

47
00:02:35,159 --> 00:02:35,759
That's right.

48
00:02:36,719 --> 00:02:37,759
The person in those photos

49
00:02:38,719 --> 00:02:39,360
is me.

50
00:02:39,760 --> 00:02:41,080
(Ji Group Charity Gala)

51
00:02:42,439 --> 00:02:43,919
Oh my God.

52
00:02:43,919 --> 00:02:44,919
How embarrassing.

53
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:45,919
Yeah.

54
00:02:48,639 --> 00:02:50,199
Exactly.

55
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:51,840
Six years ago,

56
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:54,199
when I was in college,

57
00:02:56,039 --> 00:02:57,080
my professor,

58
00:02:57,639 --> 00:02:58,800
Professor Ge,

59
00:02:58,800 --> 00:02:59,800
assaulted me.

60
00:03:00,759 --> 00:03:01,680
(Top lawyer seduces prof to get ahead)
These photos

61
00:03:02,719 --> 00:03:03,800
were taken by his wife

62
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:05,039
back then.

63
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:08,719
Su Yan.

64
00:03:11,639 --> 00:03:12,479
Su Yan...

65
00:03:13,639 --> 00:03:14,599
It's been six years.

66
00:03:15,039 --> 00:03:16,159
I never thought

67
00:03:16,479 --> 00:03:17,840
you'd still be hung up

68
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:18,759
on the past.

69
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:21,280
I'm married now.

70
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:22,960
You need to

71
00:03:23,319 --> 00:03:24,360
let me go.

72
00:03:29,039 --> 00:03:31,319
So Su Yan knew he was married
and went after him anyway?

73
00:03:31,319 --> 00:03:33,039
Shameless.

74
00:03:33,039 --> 00:03:35,719
I bet she slept her way

75
00:03:35,719 --> 00:03:36,719
to senior partner too.

76
00:03:36,719 --> 00:03:37,800
Obviously.

77
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:39,039
Six years ago,

78
00:03:39,039 --> 00:03:40,360
my biggest regret

79
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:42,159
was not calling the police on you.

80
00:03:42,159 --> 00:03:43,039
I thought

81
00:03:43,039 --> 00:03:44,360
if I swallowed it all,

82
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:46,879
at least I'd keep my dignity.

83
00:03:47,639 --> 00:03:48,599
But I was wrong.

84
00:03:49,719 --> 00:03:50,759
All that filth I swallowed

85
00:03:51,879 --> 00:03:53,439
only festered inside me.

86
00:03:54,199 --> 00:03:54,879
Su Yan.

87
00:03:56,199 --> 00:03:57,759
Back then, you did everything you could

88
00:03:58,280 --> 00:03:59,759
to get close to me.

89
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:02,159
Even if you'd done nothing,

90
00:04:02,439 --> 00:04:04,280
I would've helped you.

91
00:04:05,039 --> 00:04:06,000
And now,

92
00:04:06,159 --> 00:04:07,560
you're slandering me

93
00:04:08,159 --> 00:04:09,599
just to clear your own name.

94
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:11,280
But don't forget,

95
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:14,000
accusations require evidence.

96
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:16,208
You're the biggest

97
00:04:16,209 --> 00:04:17,600
hypocrite I've ever met.

98
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:18,920
Dad.

99
00:04:23,519 --> 00:04:25,199
You want evidence, Professor Ge?

100
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:26,680
Then here it is.

101
00:04:30,199 --> 00:04:31,800
(I just want to ruin her.)

102
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:34,120
(She stole the guy I wanted.)

103
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:40,439
(Twenty minutes earlier)

104
00:04:40,439 --> 00:04:41,160
I'm warning you.

105
00:04:41,839 --> 00:04:43,040
Stop plotting against her.

106
00:04:43,439 --> 00:04:44,879
Your dad, Professor Ge,

107
00:04:44,880 --> 00:04:45,959
assaulted Ms. Su.

108
00:04:46,319 --> 00:04:47,720
He did the same thing

109
00:04:47,720 --> 00:04:49,360
to other female students, didn't he?

110
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:51,240
You and your mom won't confront him,

111
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:53,560
but you'll hound the victim instead?

112
00:04:55,160 --> 00:04:56,519
I want to ruin her.

113
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:58,519
Why does she get my dad's love?

114
00:04:58,680 --> 00:05:00,560
Out of all his students,

115
00:05:00,560 --> 00:05:02,519
