118
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:08,160
Then I'll tear her down.

119
00:05:08,519 --> 00:05:09,839
Her reputation's already ruined.

120
00:05:10,079 --> 00:05:12,439
No one will believe she's innocent.

121
00:05:15,959 --> 00:05:17,560
How could this happen?

122
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:18,439
Exactly.

123
00:05:19,160 --> 00:05:20,079
How could this happen?

124
00:05:20,079 --> 00:05:21,040
That's awful.

125
00:05:21,279 --> 00:05:22,000
What's going on?

126
00:05:23,439 --> 00:05:23,839
Hey!

127
00:05:24,079 --> 00:05:24,680
What are you doing?

128
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:24,959
Move.

129
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:26,839
It wasn't me!

130
00:05:27,439 --> 00:05:28,000
It wasn't me!

131
00:05:28,879 --> 00:05:29,920
I'm sorry, Mr. Ji.

132
00:05:30,319 --> 00:05:31,439
It... it was Ge Yao!

133
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:33,160
Ge Yao told me
to put those photos on screen!

134
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:37,680
Ms. Ge.

135
00:05:38,480 --> 00:05:39,920
Anything else to say?

136
00:05:40,839 --> 00:05:42,240
So it really was assault.

137
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:43,639
- Oh my God.
- Exactly.

138
00:05:43,639 --> 00:05:45,120
And there were other victims.

139
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:46,959
He's a total hypocrite.

140
00:05:46,959 --> 00:05:47,959
Shameless.

141
00:05:47,959 --> 00:05:48,920
Exactly.

142
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:51,120
Dad, let's go.

143
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:52,000
So that's what happened.

144
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:54,519
Exactly.

145
00:05:56,439 --> 00:05:58,000
He still has the nerve to show his face.

146
00:05:58,160 --> 00:05:59,480
Doesn't he feel any shame?

147
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:11,600
